    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 2.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And þæt is þonne ærest, þæt he his agenne wer Criste ⁊ þam cyningce gesylle ⁊ mid þam hine sylfne inlagie to bote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the first condition is, that he shall give his own wergeld to Christ and to the king and by that means obtain the legal right to offer compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And þæt is þonne ærest, þæt he his agenne wer Criste ⁊ þam cyningce gesylle, ⁊ mid þam hine sylfne inlagie to bote.</ab>
      </div>
